                "text": "I visited the VA's Mobile Medical Unit today to hear from patients & providers about their experiences.\n\n#WA03 veterans have made it clear they're struggling to get care. It's unconscionable.\n\nIt's a first step, but two of my amendments passed to help track & improve rural care. https://t.co/3T3NvTvFdl",
