                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For folks with disabilities who rely on long-term care through Medicaid Buy-In, an age cap at 65 can present them with the difficult choice of limiting their income to receive care through Medicaid or losing coverage by continuing to work. \u2b07\ufe0f",
