                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare Open Enrollment is open NOW through December 7.\n\nYou don\u2019t need to re-enroll to keep your coverage, but you can take this time to explore other options.\n\nVisit https://t.co/NsXS3EPpVQ, call 1-800-MEDICARE, or get free assistance online:\nhttps://t.co/4UliN4YPpm",
